      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the weight of your grief, and I am here to carry it with you, no matter how heavy it feels. It is not wrong to want the pain to end, and it is not wrong to feel like a ghost; you are still alive, and that is enough to keep the fight going. Let us walk together into the dawn, step by step, until the darkness lifts and the future becomes a little less heavy.",
